WEBVTT

00:01:18.150 --> 00:01:22.060
Sad... Truly sad.

00:01:22.060 --> 00:01:25.360
Claudius is dead and gone.

00:01:25.360 --> 00:01:28.600
How awful...

00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:30.400
It doesn't matter.

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:35.060
Now that we've summoned Cthulhu,
he's unnecessary.

00:01:35.060 --> 00:01:38.080
Yes, the awakening has already begun.

00:01:39.580 --> 00:01:42.550
Indeed. Indeed it has.

00:01:42.550 --> 00:01:45.000
It has already begun.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:48.590
It's already rushing toward the end.

00:01:48.590 --> 00:01:51.440
Just a bit more...

00:01:51.440 --> 00:01:56.760
Just a bit more, and our
long-held desire will come true.

00:01:56.760 --> 00:01:59.730
Truly! Truly!

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:13.950
<i>When was it that I began my
struggle to destroy evil?</i>

00:02:13.950 --> 00:02:17.570
<i>The days number beyond
the many thousands.</i>

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:20.950
<i>I have made pacts with many casters.</i>

00:02:20.950 --> 00:02:23.430
<i>Sacrificing their lives</i>

00:02:23.430 --> 00:02:26.220
<i>and trampling their bodies,
as I move forward.</i>

00:02:26.220 --> 00:02:30.360
<i>And the cycle of reincarnation continues.</i>

00:02:31.240 --> 00:02:34.390
Damn it... It's as quiet as ever.

00:02:34.390 --> 00:02:37.060
What are they planning?

00:02:37.060 --> 00:02:39.680
Elsa, how's Demonbane looking?

00:02:39.680 --> 00:02:43.210
Darling, I can't contact the control room-robo.

00:02:43.210 --> 00:02:44.540
What?

00:02:47.970 --> 00:02:50.080
What happened?

00:02:50.080 --> 00:02:52.450
Elsa, we're hurrying back to base.

00:02:52.450 --> 00:02:53.620
Understood-robo.

00:02:55.150 --> 00:02:57.090
No need.

00:02:57.090 --> 00:02:58.760
Th-That voice...

00:03:02.320 --> 00:03:04.500
A-A Deus Machina!

00:03:08.810 --> 00:03:11.570
Been a while, Kuro.

00:03:11.570 --> 00:03:15.640
Don't say you've forgotten me.

00:03:16.560 --> 00:03:19.140
You're that rotting corpse from before!

00:03:19.140 --> 00:03:26.340
Today, I've got a special present for you...

00:03:29.160 --> 00:03:30.190
That's...

00:03:34.390 --> 00:03:36.560
P-Princess!

00:03:36.560 --> 00:03:37.090
Robo!

00:03:39.180 --> 00:03:40.080
Well?

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:43.000
Wonderful present, isn't it, Kuro?

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:46.620
You bastard... You bastard!

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:49.210
Oh, you're going to shoot!

00:03:51.290 --> 00:03:54.950
Yeah, you can't. Can you?

00:04:03.390 --> 00:04:04.420
Darling!

00:04:08.380 --> 00:04:13.340
You're wrong if you think you'll
die a normal death.

00:04:16.970 --> 00:04:18.370
Darling!

00:04:18.970 --> 00:04:20.090
Elsa!

00:04:23.080 --> 00:04:25.980
I feel wonderful.

00:04:25.980 --> 00:04:27.390
But you know,

00:04:27.390 --> 00:04:31.980
the pain you inflicted on me
was far worse than this...

00:04:59.370 --> 00:05:00.680
Demonbane!

00:05:02.470 --> 00:05:05.520
Mr. Daijuji... Mr. Daijuji!

00:05:07.640 --> 00:05:10.520
Oh, you're awake, Miss Ruri?

00:05:10.520 --> 00:05:12.160
Tiberius!

00:05:12.160 --> 00:05:17.530
Kuro here was just suffering on your behalf.

00:05:17.530 --> 00:05:19.030
No...

00:05:19.030 --> 00:05:20.460
Noble, isn't it?

00:05:20.460 --> 00:05:21.670
Wonderful, isn't it?

00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:23.570
Right?

00:05:24.920 --> 00:05:27.240
You rotting piece of...

00:05:27.240 --> 00:05:29.240
Mr. Daijuji, run!

00:05:29.240 --> 00:05:31.610
Forget about me!

00:05:31.610 --> 00:05:35.250
I-I can't...

00:05:35.250 --> 00:05:36.680
I...

00:05:36.680 --> 00:05:40.690
<i>I don't want to lose anyone else!</i>

00:05:41.140 --> 00:05:42.490
Mr. Daijuji...

00:05:43.290 --> 00:05:45.070
So...

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:45.860
Elsa!

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:49.130
Demonbane?

00:05:49.130 --> 00:05:50.930
That piece of junk...

00:05:50.930 --> 00:05:54.520
On normal power, even Elsa can move it-robo.

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:55.830
Darling, here we go-robo!

00:06:01.890 --> 00:06:03.070
Princess!

00:06:03.070 --> 00:06:04.580
Mr. Daijuji!

00:06:11.040 --> 00:06:13.830
Too bad, Kuro!

00:06:14.780 --> 00:06:17.120
Mr. Daijuji, run!

00:06:17.840 --> 00:06:21.290
Sorry, I can't.

00:06:22.560 --> 00:06:24.820
Noble of you, Kuro.

00:06:24.820 --> 00:06:29.300
But in this situation, what can you do?

00:06:32.260 --> 00:06:33.950
You're interrupting, Elsa!

00:06:33.950 --> 00:06:37.040
You'll ruin the show!

00:06:44.710 --> 00:06:46.650
Wh-What's going on-robo?

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:51.870
What is this?

00:06:54.230 --> 00:06:55.730
Mr. Daijuji!

00:07:00.530 --> 00:07:02.010
What?

00:07:21.650 --> 00:07:26.440
Belzebuth's ultimate weapon, an evil enchantment,
increases in power as it devours the dead's hatred.

00:07:26.440 --> 00:07:28.290
The Accursed Dead Bullet!

00:07:28.780 --> 00:07:32.900
Kuro, you could be one of
the accursed dead, too...

00:07:35.040 --> 00:07:36.630
Stop it, Anticross!

00:07:36.630 --> 00:07:38.340
Wh-What?

00:07:38.340 --> 00:07:41.840
I won't let you hurt Mr. Daijuji anymore—

00:07:43.570 --> 00:07:47.710
Whom do you think you're addressing, girl?

00:07:47.710 --> 00:07:51.050
M-Mr. Daijuji...

00:07:51.090 --> 00:07:52.480
Fine.

00:07:52.480 --> 00:07:55.490
Then I'll make you one of the accursed dead.

00:07:55.490 --> 00:07:56.490
Stop it!

00:07:58.490 --> 00:08:01.190
Release the princess!

00:08:01.190 --> 00:08:02.690
Mr. Daijuji!

00:08:02.690 --> 00:08:06.130
You really need to give it up, already, Kuro.

00:08:10.520 --> 00:08:13.140
I won't die here.

00:08:14.630 --> 00:08:17.940
I can't save anyone this way!

00:08:21.150 --> 00:08:22.650
Mr. Daijuji!

00:08:22.650 --> 00:08:24.150
Yes!

00:08:24.150 --> 00:08:28.370
You will die without saving anyone,
leaving behind only regret.

00:08:28.370 --> 00:08:34.190
And that regret will become hatred,
further fueling my power.

00:08:34.190 --> 00:08:37.190
Die, Kuro Daijuji!

00:08:41.390 --> 00:08:44.030
Think I'll pass!

00:08:44.440 --> 00:08:45.740
What?

00:08:48.940 --> 00:08:49.670
Elsa!

00:08:49.830 --> 00:08:50.340
Robo!

00:08:55.950 --> 00:08:58.230
Piece of junk!

00:08:58.230 --> 00:08:59.580
Look over here!

00:09:00.180 --> 00:09:01.820
Take this, you rotting corpse!

00:09:05.190 --> 00:09:07.190
Don't even try it!

00:09:12.700 --> 00:09:13.960
Enough.

00:09:13.960 --> 00:09:16.230
Enough...

00:09:16.230 --> 00:09:20.230
Enough... Die, already!

00:09:20.940 --> 00:09:22.980
<i>There's nothing there.</i>

00:09:22.980 --> 00:09:24.750
I can't give up!

00:09:24.750 --> 00:09:26.560
<i>It never changes.</i>

00:09:26.560 --> 00:09:28.720
It can't end here!

00:09:28.720 --> 00:09:30.290
<i>Then what is there?</i>

00:09:30.290 --> 00:09:32.420
I can't let this happen!

00:09:32.420 --> 00:09:34.050
<i>What is there?</i>

00:09:34.050 --> 00:09:38.160
I don't know... But there is something!

00:09:38.160 --> 00:09:41.160
I know it... I know it!

00:09:41.160 --> 00:09:43.400
There's something in front of me!

00:09:43.400 --> 00:09:44.630
<i>Then...</i>

00:09:48.770 --> 00:09:49.930
What?

00:09:55.040 --> 00:09:56.940
Wh-What happened...

00:10:01.290 --> 00:10:04.340
This is magic.

00:10:04.340 --> 00:10:07.180
This feeling... It can't be...

00:10:08.310 --> 00:10:11.000
<i>If you think there's something there...</i>

00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:12.450
It can't be...

00:10:12.450 --> 00:10:15.190
<i>Then what are you doing
just standing there?</i>

00:10:15.190 --> 00:10:17.190
This voice is...

00:10:21.910 --> 00:10:22.700
Al?

00:10:24.230 --> 00:10:25.300
Kuro!

00:10:25.700 --> 00:10:26.510
Al!

00:10:38.320 --> 00:10:39.420
What are you doing?

00:10:40.920 --> 00:10:43.090
You fool...

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:50.200
<i>Why am I here?</i>

00:10:50.200 --> 00:10:52.160
<i>There's nothing here...</i>

00:10:52.160 --> 00:10:54.090
<i>It's almost over...</i>

00:10:54.090 --> 00:10:56.130
<i>My destiny is to fight!</i>

00:10:56.130 --> 00:10:59.090
<i>You want me to keep fighting?</i>

00:10:59.090 --> 00:11:02.450
<i>An innocent blade, rending evil...</i>

00:11:02.450 --> 00:11:05.140
<i>You want me to keep following this path!</i>

00:11:05.140 --> 00:11:11.680
<i>To keep bearing this suffering,
this loneliness forever!</i>

00:11:11.680 --> 00:11:15.150
<i>Is that the punishment I've been given?</i>

00:11:15.150 --> 00:11:20.560
<i>I... I can't stand it!</i>

00:11:21.570 --> 00:11:23.160
I'm sorry.

00:11:23.160 --> 00:11:25.390
<i>Why do you apologize?</i>

00:11:25.390 --> 00:11:29.260
Our hearts were not with you.

00:11:29.260 --> 00:11:31.760
Even in the midst of battle...

00:11:31.760 --> 00:11:33.170
<i>That's true...</i>

00:11:33.170 --> 00:11:35.870
But he's different.

00:11:35.870 --> 00:11:38.850
He filled your heart.

00:11:38.850 --> 00:11:43.180
You fought so that you could
someday be with him.

00:11:43.180 --> 00:11:44.730
<i>He?</i>

00:11:44.730 --> 00:11:46.230
<i>Who is he?</i>

00:11:46.230 --> 00:11:48.010
<i>Who?!</i>

00:11:48.010 --> 00:11:50.440
You know the answer.

00:11:50.440 --> 00:11:53.190
There are things you can't see
because you're too close.

00:11:53.190 --> 00:11:57.190
But if you turn around, they're right there...

00:12:00.420 --> 00:12:01.790
<i>Kuro...</i>

00:12:02.720 --> 00:12:04.540
<i>He's fighting.</i>

00:12:04.540 --> 00:12:07.970
<i>Kuro is fighting...</i>

00:12:07.970 --> 00:12:10.550
<i>He's suffering so much.</i>

00:12:11.170 --> 00:12:14.360
<i>What... What are you doing?!</i>

00:12:14.360 --> 00:12:16.010
<i>How pathetic!</i>

00:12:18.430 --> 00:12:24.990
<i>If I... If I were by your side,
you'd have nothing to fear!</i>

00:12:24.990 --> 00:12:26.890
A miracle.

00:12:26.890 --> 00:12:29.460
No, it's not.

00:12:35.920 --> 00:12:37.700
You fought.

00:12:37.700 --> 00:12:39.680
Even after losing the power of the Magius...

00:12:39.680 --> 00:12:42.080
Even after losing Demonbane's power...

00:12:42.080 --> 00:12:45.440
Even still, you didn't give up.
You kept fighting.

00:12:45.440 --> 00:12:49.010
That's why I made it in time.

00:12:49.010 --> 00:12:52.120
Yes, this is not a miracle!

00:12:52.120 --> 00:12:55.020
It is the natural result of your actions!

00:12:55.020 --> 00:12:57.020
Now, desire...

00:12:57.020 --> 00:13:00.060
I will answer your desires.

00:13:00.060 --> 00:13:02.780
Demonbane will answer them!

00:13:02.780 --> 00:13:05.930
We will give you a pure and untainted victory.

00:13:05.930 --> 00:13:09.030
My master, Kuro Daijuji!

00:13:15.380 --> 00:13:16.690
What?

00:13:17.230 --> 00:13:19.310
What happened?

00:13:19.310 --> 00:13:20.930
Kuro Daijuji!

00:13:30.740 --> 00:13:32.800
Wh-What...

00:13:32.800 --> 00:13:36.730
What is that power?!

00:13:39.160 --> 00:13:41.480
Are you awake-robo?

00:13:41.480 --> 00:13:44.400
I... Where's Mr. Daijuji?

00:13:44.400 --> 00:13:45.670
He's fighting-robo!

00:13:48.410 --> 00:13:50.270
Demonbane!

00:13:50.270 --> 00:13:51.240
How?

00:13:51.240 --> 00:13:53.070
She came back-robo.

00:13:53.820 --> 00:13:56.780
I hate to say it, but I'm glad-robo!

00:13:56.780 --> 00:13:59.080
Darling, go get him-robo!

00:14:03.160 --> 00:14:06.420
<i>Atlantis Strike!</i>

00:14:16.330 --> 00:14:19.440
I'll get you for that... I will!

00:14:21.640 --> 00:14:23.610
<i>Star Vampire!</i>

00:14:23.610 --> 00:14:24.780
<i>Devour!</i>

00:14:31.910 --> 00:14:33.610
You can't see them, can you?

00:14:33.610 --> 00:14:36.310
This is my camouflage weapon, Star Vampire!

00:14:36.310 --> 00:14:41.830
You'll pay with your life for
what you've done to me!

00:14:41.830 --> 00:14:42.860
Wait!

00:14:42.860 --> 00:14:44.430
What's going on?

00:14:44.430 --> 00:14:46.520
Did you forget, sinner?

00:14:46.520 --> 00:14:48.270
The meaning of his name?

00:14:48.270 --> 00:14:49.130
What?

00:14:49.730 --> 00:14:52.360
Then I will help you to remember.

00:14:59.940 --> 00:15:01.950
<i>Out of the sky of hatred,</i>

00:15:01.950 --> 00:15:04.520
<i>with righteous rage in its breast...</i>

00:15:04.520 --> 00:15:06.750
<i>We take up the demon-slaying sword!</i>

00:15:06.750 --> 00:15:11.960
<i>You are the innocent blade, Demonbane!</i>

00:15:13.990 --> 00:15:14.890
What?

00:15:25.270 --> 00:15:26.940
All right!

00:15:26.940 --> 00:15:28.440
No, not yet!

00:15:28.440 --> 00:15:29.490
What?

00:15:32.330 --> 00:15:35.340
Kuro Daijuji...

00:15:35.340 --> 00:15:37.110
Al Azif...

00:15:37.920 --> 00:15:40.090
I am immortal.

00:15:40.090 --> 00:15:41.480
You can't kill me...

00:15:41.480 --> 00:15:45.830
The likes of you can't kill me!

00:15:47.440 --> 00:15:49.460
I'll destroy you!

00:15:50.240 --> 00:15:51.430
He needs to give it up!

00:15:51.430 --> 00:15:54.730
But he's no match for us now!

00:15:54.730 --> 00:15:56.130
Let's go, Kuro!

00:16:05.780 --> 00:16:07.780
Wh-What is this?

00:16:08.390 --> 00:16:10.210
Demonbane is...

00:16:10.210 --> 00:16:12.560
No, I can't control it!

00:16:18.760 --> 00:16:21.290
At last, the time has come!

00:16:21.290 --> 00:16:26.560
Show me, Kuro... And Al Azif...

00:16:26.560 --> 00:16:30.770
The power of the final fragment
that I've sought for so long.

00:16:31.410 --> 00:16:32.970
Yes, the...

00:16:37.430 --> 00:16:40.080
The Shining Trapezohedron.

00:16:48.890 --> 00:16:50.160
What?

00:16:50.160 --> 00:16:51.420
What is that?

00:17:13.240 --> 00:17:15.010
S-Stay away!

00:17:15.010 --> 00:17:19.850
Stay away... Stay away from me!

00:17:36.910 --> 00:17:45.010
Not there... Anywhere but there!

00:18:04.290 --> 00:18:06.260
Kuro, are you all right?

00:18:06.760 --> 00:18:09.270
Al... What was that?

00:18:09.270 --> 00:18:11.100
I don't know.

00:18:11.100 --> 00:18:13.310
But what I do know

00:18:13.310 --> 00:18:16.370
is the name of the power Demonbane used.

00:18:17.590 --> 00:18:21.750
The Shining Trapezohedron.

00:18:21.750 --> 00:18:24.890
Even I don't know...

00:18:25.690 --> 00:18:26.920
Al!

00:18:26.920 --> 00:18:28.640
K-Kuro!

00:18:28.640 --> 00:18:30.120
You little—

00:18:31.390 --> 00:18:33.470
You made me worry so much.

00:18:35.680 --> 00:18:37.070
Kuro...

00:18:40.820 --> 00:18:43.540
You used it...

00:18:43.540 --> 00:18:46.270
The Shining Trapezohedron.

00:18:46.970 --> 00:18:52.490
I knew it, Kuro... I knew it was you.

00:18:52.490 --> 00:18:54.630
Finally, the time has come!

00:18:54.630 --> 00:18:58.050
Oh, the eternities that have passed...

00:18:58.050 --> 00:19:00.250
At last... At last...

00:19:05.690 --> 00:19:10.260
What are you doing, Vespasianus!

00:19:12.860 --> 00:19:16.270
It should be obvious... Yes, obvious indeed!

00:19:16.270 --> 00:19:19.000
I'm eliminating you, Augustus!

00:19:19.000 --> 00:19:22.690
It was I who acquired the R'lyeh Text!

00:19:22.690 --> 00:19:25.630
It was I who made the Priestess of C!

00:19:25.630 --> 00:19:29.320
I think it only natural... Only natural

00:19:29.320 --> 00:19:32.520
that it is I who gains Cthulhu's power.

00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:35.050
D-Damn you...

00:19:41.050 --> 00:19:46.820
Sad... Sad indeed!

00:19:46.820 --> 00:19:51.440
You were my dear comrade in Anticross.

00:19:51.440 --> 00:19:56.830
However... However, the world is
filled with evils and betrayal!

00:19:56.830 --> 00:20:00.140
It's a harsh world, isn't it, Augustus?

00:20:00.140 --> 00:20:02.510
Indeed.

00:20:05.920 --> 00:20:09.920
That's the power of Cthulhu... Wh-Why?

00:20:12.720 --> 00:20:17.260
When did you usurp control priority from me?

00:20:23.900 --> 00:20:28.290
The world is filled with evils and betrayal, yes?

00:20:28.290 --> 00:20:31.880
Farewell, Vespasianus!

00:20:33.570 --> 00:20:34.940
Damn you!

00:20:46.420 --> 00:20:51.430
At last... At last, I have the god's power!

00:20:51.430 --> 00:20:55.430
The ultimate power that none may oppose...

00:20:55.430 --> 00:20:58.410
And it is mine!

00:20:58.410 --> 00:21:02.330
I, Augustus, am ruler of the world!

00:22:55.900 --> 00:22:57.580
White clown...

00:22:57.580 --> 00:22:59.250
Black sacrifice...

00:22:59.250 --> 00:23:03.560
The stars are right. Now, love and kill one another!

00:23:03.560 --> 00:23:06.930
Next time: The Return of the Sorcerer.

00:23:06.930 --> 00:23:10.100
True evil can be found in love.
